/*!
    \qmlmodule Shadcn
    \title Shadcn QML Components
    \brief shadcn/ui (base-mira style) ported to Qt Quick / QML.

    A reusable Qt Quick component library that mirrors the shadcn/ui component
    set in the compact base-mira style. Import the module and use the components
    directly:

    \qml
    import QtQuick
    import Shadcn

    Button { text: "Click me"; onClicked: dialog.open() }
    \endqml

    The pages below document each component's public API (properties, signals,
    methods and enums).
*/
